			"url": "https://github.com/golang/go/issues/62483",
			"summary": "A Go runtime team member proposes a standard library package, first called intern, that returns a comparable globally unique handle for any comparable value, backed by a runtime-integrated weak map, replacing the go4.org/intern copy already in the standard library.",
			"actorId": 1248668,
			"actorType": "human"
		},
		{
			"id": "go-62483:comment:1708845101",
			"kind": "comment",
			"actor": "seebs",
			"createdAt": "2023-09-06T17:56:43Z",
			"url": "https://github.com/golang/go/issues/62483#issuecomment-1708845101",
			"summary": "A contributor likes it and asks whether weakly keyed or weakly valued maps would solve interning more generally.",
			"actorId": 166725,
			"actorType": "human",
			"parentId": "go-62483:issue:62483"
		},
		{
			"id": "go-62483:comment:1708849598",
