			"editedAt": "2023-09-06T18:07:32Z",
			"url": "https://github.com/golang/go/issues/62483#issuecomment-1708849598",
			"summary": "The proposer says the team explored weak-keyed maps (ephemerons) and found them insufficient for interning, though useful elsewhere.",
